{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "151", "x": 0.8995833693452233, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.0341598792584124, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "that pots do. And even if ancient pots are found in in small pieces. They still", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.12378835115115883, "w": 0.7721985235791502, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "provide a lot of information about the past. There's no doubt that pottery has", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.15211877666808146, "w": 0.7716744160153, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "given archaeologists a fascinating insight into how ancient humans lived.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.1804491267422191, "w": 0.7714566530134186, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "The shape of an artifact may have been lost. But archaeologists can tell", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.20877947681635672, "w": 0.7713913446178449, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "whether the pots were for, say, storage or cooking by examining the", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.23710982689049434, "w": 0.7717057886511642, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "impressions on the clay. The scratches from tools and the clay itself can", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2652919318920643, "w": 0.7714567555383723, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "reveal where the pots came from. When I ask people why they want to take", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2936593243736476, "w": 0.7714783883036251, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "a pottery class with me, they sometimes talk about these things. Like our", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.321989731029874, "w": 0.7722051877011475, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "ancestors, they hope that something they create will also last longer than", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3503200811040116, "w": 0.7714131824330053, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "they do. That their work, whether it is good or not, might say something about", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3786504311781492, "w": 0.7715658420892207, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "humanity many years after their death. Of course, you will all have your own", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4069808189736794, "w": 0.7717832975162408, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "reasons for coming here. As far as I'm concerned, what I love most is the", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4353112067692095, "w": 0.7716157717417237, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "concentration you need to make a good pot. That focus takes you away from", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4636415568433471, "w": 0.7716744160153, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the stresses of everyday life. If you're elderly, it's also good exercise for", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4919966521509719, "w": 0.7713914471427987, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "hands and wrists and helps with arthritis. And of course, it's a fun activity for", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.520327039946502, "w": 0.7719241668027685, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "children because it's so messy. Here at Adelman Pottery, we show you some", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5486573900206396, "w": 0.7716744160153, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "of the basic pottery techniques so that you can use these to create whatever", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5769877778161697, "w": 0.7716527832500472, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "you wish. A gift for a friend perhaps. Like nearly everyone who comes here,", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6053181278903074, "w": 0.7721832473610333, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "I'm sure this is the first time you will have tried the art. So, we'll keep things", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.633648477964445, "w": 0.7713477715124778, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "simple today. Now, before we move on, on. Can I just say a word about what", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6620160213315983, "w": 0.77119531690617, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "you're wearing? As we said in our email, please remove any watches,", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6903462959629509, "w": 0.7714782857786714, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "necklaces, etc., and put them somewhere safe. If you have long hair, do tie it", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7186767214798736, "w": 0.7717520274053302, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "back now. We'll provide aprons later, but I trust your clothes are old, but", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7468587510386585, "w": 0.7713478740374317, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "comfortable, not your favorite t-shirt or jeans.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7751891011127962, "w": 0.4675725361485045, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Heather McCallum: So, now we're in the workshop. Have a look around.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8035195266297188, "w": 0.7712172572462843, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "There's a lot going on. To make pottery that will last, you need a potter's", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8318498767038565, "w": 0.7714329697490897, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "wheel, a kil, which is basically a very hot oven where you fire the pottery, and", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8602049720114812, "w": 0.7717615622260341, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "some tools. So, first the kil. If you look over in the far corner, You'll see one", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8885353220856188, "w": 0.7712607278266975, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "of ours. Since their invention, kils have changed very little. Though in the past", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.9168656721597565, "w": 0.7718268706216078, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}